----------
scriptunit-fragment 1
----------

var b = 125

----------
scriptunit-fragment 2
----------

let big = b .> 100

----------
scriptunit-fragment 3
----------

let shown = big

----------
expect all three units are entered
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | compiles, runs | new | `b` = 125 |
| 2 | reads `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `big` = true |
| 3 | reads `big` (2) | compiles, runs | new | `shown` = true |

----------
scriptunit-edit 1
----------

var b = 126

----------
expect unit 1 is edited, and `big` comes out the same
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | recompiles, runs | edited | `b` = 126 |
| 2 | reads `b` (1) | reruns | reads `b` from unit 1 | `big` = true |
| 3 | reads `big` (2) | untouched | `big` is what it was | `shown` = true |

----------
engine
----------

| unit | this step | note |
|------|-----------|------|
| 3 | reruns | does not compare a rerun unit's values with what they were |
